Package: xyt
Type: Package
Title: Extract Raster Time Series Values at Points in Space and Time
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
   person("Michael D.", "Sumner", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "michael.sumner@aad.gov.au")
   )
Description: Extract values from a time series of rasters at points that each
    carry their own date-time. The series is described by a reader function
    rather than by data held in memory, so only the time slices actually
    needed are read. Values are taken from the slice nearest in time, or
    interpolated linearly between the two slices that bracket each point.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    terra (>= 1.7.0)
Suggests:
    mirai (>= 1.3.0),
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
